      "description": "Fires when a target is scraped successfully but emits no healthcheck series - one service whose checks were dropped while its container stays up. Metric Missing cannot catch that, because the other services are still emitting. A set difference, not count-minus-count: the arithmetic form cancels a not-reporting target against a down target whose series are still stale. Job-wide: the app filter does not apply.",
